      "text": "[student@workstation ~]$ oc get httpRoute/nb-myfirstproject-my-wb-02 -n redhat-ods-applications -o yaml\n\napiVersion: gateway.networking.k8s.io/v1\nkind: HTTPRoute\nmetadata:\n  labels:\n    notebook-name: my-wb-02\n    notebook-namespace: myfirstproject\n\n  name: nb-myfirstproject-my-wb-02\n  namespace: redhat-ods-applications\n\n...\n\nspec:\n  parentRefs:\n  - group: gateway.networking.k8s.io\n    kind: Gateway\n    name: data-science-gateway\n    namespace: openshift-ingress\n  rules:\n  - backendRefs:\n    - group: \"\"\n      kind: Service\n      name: my-wb-02-kube-rbac-proxy\n      namespace: myfirstproject\n      port: 8443\n      weight: 1\n\n    matches:\n    - path:\n        type: PathPrefix\n\n        value: /notebook/myfirstproject/my-wb-02",
